chars': 4295, 'exposed': True}, {'id': 'ev-42cada09d7411017eb46', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'version': 'b4767423c79db69ae7138f4c0aed7733af6385e0a370da21ad7d6fe029d7fb8c', 'locator': 'page:50', 'required': True, 'page': 50, 'valid': True, 'atomic': True, 'chars': 4663, 'exposed': True}, {'id': 'ev-99f0f0a37d328bfed1a9', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'version': 'b4767423c79db69ae7138f4c0aed7733af6385e0a370da21ad7d6fe029d7fb8c', 'locator': 'page:51', 'required': True, 'page': 51, 'valid': True, 'atomic': True, 'chars': 3844, 'exposed': True}, {'id': 'ev-01ce8948bcc88d235ea3', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'version': 'b4767423c79db69ae7138f4c0aed7733af6385e0a370da21ad7d6fe029d7fb8c', 'locator': 'page:52', 'required': True, 'page': 52, 'valid': True, 'atomic': True, 'chars': 4072, 'exposed': True}], 'notes': {'reasoning': {'id': 'reasoning', 'content': '推理类方法以 CoT 为骨架。Self Consistency 采样多条推理路径后按多数投票（most frequent answer）确定最终答案，而不是取单一链。Tree of Thoughts 将其扩展为带评估与回溯的树搜索，并使用广度优先与深度优先两种控制器。此外还有 Prompt-Improvement（PHP 迭代直至答案稳定）、Self Refine（生成-反馈-精炼三提示）、Reflexion（actor/evaluator/reflector）与 Self Discover；自反思需要外部记忆以保存树遍历或提示评估状态。DeepSeek-R1 走隐式推理路线，用 GRPO 强化学习训练推理步骤。受限之处：外部提示循环成本高，隐式推理仍属开放研究。', 'sources': ['paper.pdf'], 'evidence_ids': ['ev-2c5302116a7f6c84effa', 'ev-b8db09947ef7c899cd9d', 'ev-ced75d6936911b2f0248', 'ev-9317b06df60c30a6c12c'], 'valid': True, 'request': 8}}, 'answers': {'overview': {'categories': {'answer': ['reasoning', 'acting', 'interacting'], 'evidence_id': 'ev-26c94297c50e4ef408a2', 'page': 4, 'quote': 'The categories reasoning–acting–interacting build upon each other: the technology that has been developed by the reasoning approaches (category 1) is used for increasingly intelligent acting by assistants.'}, 'search_methods': {'answer': ['google_scholar', 'snowballing'], 'evidence_id': 'ev-dbca06e364385e22f3c5', 'page': 5, 'quote': 'The papers were initially selected with a Google Scholar search on Agentic LLM. From there, we used a snowballing approach to discover work that was cited but not yet included in our initial set.'}}, 'reasoning': {'self_consistency_selection': {'answer': 'majority voting', 'evidence_id': 'ev-d2b420a2b23cdc8166d3', 'page': 10, 'quote': 'Self Consistency is an ensemble approach that samples diverse reasoning paths, evaluates them, and selects the most consistent answer using majority voting.'}, 'tot_search': {'answer': ['breadth_first', 'depth_first'], 'evidence_id': 'ev-4049593a30e2846f8394', 'page': 13, 'quote': 'The paper describes both a breadth-first and a depth-first controller.'}}, 'tool_use': {'toolbench_api_count': {'answer': 16464, 'evidence_id': 'ev-731fa63b8d34dde45e62', 'page': 23, 'quote': 'ToolBench [Qin et al., 2023] contains 16,464 APIs from RapidAPI, a large dataset of publicly available REST APIs.'}, 'toolformer_tools': {'answer': ['calculator', 'question_answering', 'search_engine', 'translation_system', 'calendar'], 'evidence_id': 'ev-731fa63b8d34dde45e62', 'page': 23, 'quote': 'A range of tools is tested: a calculator, a question-answering system, a search engine, a translation system, and a calendar.'}}, 'multi_agent': {'camel_prompting': {'answer': 'inception_prompting', 'evidence_id': 'ev-98a30db9253fff6cc9da', 'page': 37, 'quote': 'By using inception prompting and role descriptions, the agents stay in character and collaborate toward the goal by breaking down complex problems in manageable steps through dialogue.'}, 'generative_agents_evaluators': {'answer': 100, 'evidence_id': 'ev-f03e4b7f1b7fc6e66886', 'page': 47, 'quote': 'Whether the Generative Agents system generates believable behavior is evaluated with the help of 100 human evaluators. These were enlisted to rank believability of the communication patterns on four categories'}}, 'outlook': {'agenda_topics': {'answer': ['training_data', 'hallucination', 'agent_behavior', 'self_reflection', 'safety'], 'evidence_id': 'ev-99f0f0a37d328bfed1a9', 'page': 51, 'quote': 'Topic Challenge Training Data Finetune with inference time reasoning data Convergent/stable reinforcement learning VLA, Multimodal signals, such as speech Hallucination Use Self Verification Use Mechanistic Interpretability Use Open Ended/Open World Models for exploration Agent Behavior Scalable simulation infrastructure, role playing Distill reasoning to small models Models of agent and human behavior, emergent behavior, future of society Self reflection In-model self reflection and metareasoning Metacognition, personality Automated Scientific Discovery Safety Assistants: Responsibility, liability Privacy, fairness of data Wider application areas for assistants Table 4. Summary of Research Agenda for Agentic LLM'}, 'shared_foundations': {'answer': ['reasoning', 'self_verification'], 'evidence_id': 'ev-01ce8948bcc88d235ea3', 'page': 52, 'quote': 'Robotic interaction and tool-use build on grounded retrieval augmentation, social interaction (such as theory of mind) builds on self reflection, and all categories benefit from reasoning and self-verification.'}}}, 'section_text': {'overview': {'summary': '该综述把 agentic LLM 的能力分为 reasoning、acting/assistant、interacting 三大类，并按此组织全文：推理（CoT、Self Consistency、Tree of Thoughts、自反思）、工具调用与代码执行、以及多智能体交互。文献先以系统检索入手，再用前向与后向（引文/被引）滚雪球扩展；每类能力都配合大量基准与框架进行对比。局限在于：多智能体评测与长程可靠性仍欠缺统一标准，且不少结论依赖特定提示与基准。', 'application': '我的 agent 目前只实现了分页读取、命令调用、笔记与答案保存，尚未实现多智能体的合作与训练。未来可尝试让规划与执行分离，或用自一致性对多条答案投票以提高事实抽取的稳定性。'}}}
